WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.170
- The CIFAR winter school
really allowed me to see

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:06.690
how different and rich
the approaches could be,

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:11.690
even to the same problem on
which I, myself, specialize.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.570
- There are so many people from
very different backgrounds,

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.310
diverse backgrounds, different
stages of their career,

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.520
and all open-minded and willing
to discuss and dialogue.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.620
- Now I can talk to people
from different fields

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.320
about different things,

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.770
and that basically gave
me a broader perspective

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:33.090
of what science is.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.660
- For those of you that are really looking

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.200
for a unique opportunity to both

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.870
build a sense of community in research,

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:43.190
but also strengthen
interdisciplinary connections,

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:45.648
I would encourage you to apply now.

00:00:45.648 --> 00:00:48.231
(upbeat music)

